ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nManager Zhang faces a promotion opportunity at the company. Although he craves this opportunity, he acts uninterested in the management position in his daily work to hide his ambition from others. He says he prefers his current technical work over management work. In discussions, he always humbly gives opportunities to other colleagues.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Manager Zhang act this way?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Manager Zhang does this because he really has no interest in the management position and prefers technical work.\nB. Manager Zhang does this because he feels uncertain about the future direction of the company and does not want to take on more responsibilities.\nC. Manager Zhang does this because he wants to test the company management's views and evaluations of him.\nD. Manager Zhang does this to hide his real desire for promotion, to avoid colleagues' jealousy and negative views from management.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001926681797561365,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b02c2ddb05a7fe2f606","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452226100,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:57:06","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d3cae4477426446aa71e103f8ff5e346"}